    "text": "guttenbergpress.com\nwebsite\nMonona\nMFL MarMac Football Preview: Bulldogs younger, less experienced, but still intend to win\n13 hours ago\nThe MFL MarMac football team includes (front, left to right) Wolfgang Martins-Sabrina, Shane Krause, Aidan Meyer, Kyler Nuehring, Braxton Halvorson, Eli Hanson, Auston Lind, Koda Warrington, Will Howes, Anthony Bunting, manager Ariana Fish; (second row) Rylan Schroeder, Hayden Scherf, Taco Thompson, Parker Muras, Benjamin Kite, Bruce Moses, Bentley Henkes, Christian Escobar, Brody Ross, Draven Stuckman; (third row) manager Evan Bunting, Corbin Evanson, Blake Roe, Tristen Foels, Blake Schutte, Kashton Decker, Tyce Wikner, Richie Schultz, Tristan Hoopes, Cameron Hagensick, Marcus Stoddard; (fourth row) Mason Hollar, Archie Carlson, Easton Lange, Noah Troester, Kaleb Nuehring, Landon Meyer, Gage Paulus, Tyler Pecinovsky, Ashton Winkler, Kolten Strong; (back) assistant coaches Brandon Burke and Paul Gordon, head coach Dan Anderson and assistant coaches Adrian McGeough, Karter Decker and Tracy Decker. (Photo by Audrey Posten)",
